# Spanish (Spain), as the es layout of X11 (docs/design/keymaps.md).
name "Español"
include us
key grave º ª \
key 1 1 ! |
key 2 2 \" @
key 3 3 · #
key 4 4 $ ~
key 5 5 % €
key 6 6 & ¬
key 7 7 /
key 8 8 (
key 9 9 )
key 0 0 =
key minus ' ?
key equal ¡ ¿
key e e E €
key leftbrace dead_grave dead_circumflex [
key rightbrace + * ]
key semicolon ñ Ñ
key apostrophe dead_acute dead_diaeresis {
key backslash ç Ç }
key 102nd < >
key comma , ;
key dot . :
key slash - _
